    {
      "id": "scene-1",
      "type": "SCENE",
      "position": {
        "x": 52,
        "y": -36
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "The Moment",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "They arrived at the lake just before morning broke. The kind of place where sound feels afraid to exist.\n",
            "id": "ev-oat33k6kt"
          },
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "Mist rolled across the water like a slow breath\u2014 not hiding the lake, but softening its truth.\n",
            "id": "ev-dqx3i4lsq"
          },
          {
            "type": "CHAR_ENTER",
            "characterId": "aerin",
            "characterImageId": "5e2wgnn91",
            "id": "ev-wmf0ifz84"
          },
          {
            "type": "CHAR_ENTER",
            "characterId": "lyra",
            "characterImageId": "lyra-full",
            "x": 70,
            "id": "ev-5jk587fhj"
          },
          {
            "type": "DIALOGUE",
            "characterId": "lyra",
            "text": "Do you ever notice how places like this feel like questions?",
            "id": "ev-wry572s7q",
            "voiceAssetId": "audio/voices/voice_scene-1_ev-wry572s7q.mp3"
          },
          {
            "type": "DIALOGUE",
            "characterId": "aerin",
            "text": "Or answers we\u2019re not ready to hear.",
            "id": "ev-q19uqdrsd"
          }
        ],
        "backgroundImage": "Scene/lake.png"
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "selected": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 52,
        "y": -36
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
    {
      "id": "logic-fork",
      "type": "LOGIC",
      "position": {
        "x": 331.19861649083373,
        "y": -78.20207526374958
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "The Fork",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "The mist thickened. The path around the lake split\u2014 one trail followed the water\u2019s edge, the other climbed into the trees.\n",
            "id": "ev-zzwyew7ia",
            "voiceAssetId": "audio/voices/voice_logic-fork_ev-zzwyew7ia.mp3"
          }
        ],
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ch-1767475837984",
            "text": "Go to the Tree",
            "nextNodeId": "scene-b1",
            "logicRoot": {
              "id": "root-1767477767935",
              "type": "STATEMENT",
              "scope": "GAME",
              "comparison": ">",
              "value": 12,
              "attributeId": "yatz79izs"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ch-1767478961203",
            "text": "New Option",
            "nextNodeId": "scene-a1"
          }
        ]
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 202,
      "selected": false,
      "dragging": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 331.19861649083373,
        "y": -78.20207526374958
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-a1",
      "type": "SCENE",
      "position": {
        "x": 664.5802551550257,
        "y": -201.54161478206277
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "By the Water",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "Aerin stayed by the lake. Not out of fear\u2014but out of respect.",
            "id": "ev-q511kahhp"
          },
          {
            "type": "CHAR_ENTER",
            "characterId": "aerin",
            "characterImageId": "5e2wgnn91",
            "id": "ev-uglp23usi",
            "x": 38,
            "y": 82
          },
          {
            "type": "DIALOGUE",
            "characterId": "aerin",
            "text": "Some things reveal themselves only when you stop moving.",
            "id": "ev-7o0vjhkrq",
            "characterImageId": "19xd58wqy"
          }
        ],
        "backgroundImage": "Scene/lake.png"
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "selected": true,
      "dragging": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 664.5802551550257,
        "y": -201.54161478206277
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-a2",
      "type": "SCENE",
      "position": {
        "x": 1246.1474266188477,
        "y": -204.8720778456428
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Understanding",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "Shapes emerged slowly. Not visions. Not voices. Patterns.",
            "id": "ev-qes71xudk"
          },
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "The way ripples met and canceled each other out. The way branches leaned but did not break.",
            "id": "ev-9ca7bent3"
          },
          {
            "type": "DIALOGUE",
            "characterId": "aerin",
            "text": "Progress wasn\u2019t always forward. Sometimes it was deeper.",
            "id": "ev-9xbiur7hl"
          }
        ],
        "backgroundImage": "Scene/lake.png"
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "selected": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 1246.1474266188477,
        "y": -204.8720778456428
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-b1",
      "type": "SCENE",
      "position": {
        "x": 984,
        "y": 198
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Into the Trees",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "Lyra took the uphill path. She didn\u2019t look back.",
            "id": "ev-yc2me2lip"
          },
          {
            "type": "CHAR_ENTER",
            "characterId": "lyra",
            "characterImageId": "lyra-side",
            "id": "ev-jolqfihmo"
          },
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "Curiosity pulled harder than comfort ever could. The mist thinned as she climbed.",
            "id": "ev-o6wylve87"
          }
        ],
        "backgroundImage": "Scene/lake.png"
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "selected": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 984,
        "y": 198
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-b2",
      "type": "SCENE",
      "position": {
        "x": 1294,
        "y": 202
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Revelation",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "From above, she saw the lake fully. Not mysterious. Not infinite.",
            "id": "ev-6a0ue6aw3"
          },
          {
            "type": "DIALOGUE",
            "characterId": "lyra",
            "text": "Just water. Shaped by land, limited by borders. It frees me.",
            "id": "ev-mhhl2rh19"
          }
        ],
        "backgroundImage": "Scene/lake.png"
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "selected": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 1294,
        "y": 202
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-final",
      "type": "SCENE",
      "position": {
        "x": 1672,
        "y": -8
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "The Choice",
        "events": [
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "Later, they would argue about which path was right. But the lake knew better.",
            "id": "ev-domaftmjf"
          },
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "It had offered neither truth nor illusion. Only a choice.",
            "id": "ev-u8drr1hqv"
          },
          {
            "type": "NARRATION",
            "text": "\u201cSome futures ask you to stay. Others ask you to move. Both ask you to be honest.\u201d\n",
            "id": "ev-e3xsfm8un"
          }
        ],
        "backgroundImage": "Scene/lake.png"
      },
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "selected": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": 1672,
        "y": -8
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
